{"authored" [] "sources" [{"question" "q-2498" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\int \\frac{4}{{x}^{2}+1}\\,\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14011579/state.json" "file_sha256" "21f765d7644b2a4215157c91d70040aa3df95546068e8540b64200d7169e2600"} {"question" "q-2498" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Recall that \n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}\\text{d}x=\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{4}{{x}^{2}+1}\\,\\text{d}x & =4\\int \\frac{1}{{x}^{2}+1}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =4\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14011579/state.json" "file_sha256" "21f765d7644b2a4215157c91d70040aa3df95546068e8540b64200d7169e2600"} {"question" "q-2498" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14011579/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "16f3419a03bc884d0572d8450c77f4f040ab0c9cc4ce6633fc99805621d7cfb1"} {"question" "q-2498" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14011579/state.json" "file_sha256" "21f765d7644b2a4215157c91d70040aa3df95546068e8540b64200d7169e2600"} {"question" "q-2498" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "4\\,\\text{arccot}\\,x+C"] ["math" "4\\,\\text{arccsc}\\,x+C"] ["math" "4\\,\\text{arcsec}\\,x+C"] ["math" "4\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x+C"] ["math" "4\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14011579/state.json" "file_sha256" "21f765d7644b2a4215157c91d70040aa3df95546068e8540b64200d7169e2600"} {"question" "q-2498" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "4\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14011579/state.json" "file_sha256" "21f765d7644b2a4215157c91d70040aa3df95546068e8540b64200d7169e2600"} {"question" "q-49136" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "If ${f}^{′}(x)=\\frac{2}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}-3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x,$ then $f(x)=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14011579/state.json" "file_sha256" "21f765d7644b2a4215157c91d70040aa3df95546068e8540b64200d7169e2600"} {"question" "q-49136" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x=\\text{arcsec}\\,x.\n$$\n\nThen we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}f(x)=\\int {f}^{′}(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (\\frac{2}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}-3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{2}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x-\\int 3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\int \\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x-3\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\text{ arcsec }x-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14011579/state.json" "file_sha256" "21f765d7644b2a4215157c91d70040aa3df95546068e8540b64200d7169e2600"} {"question" "q-49136" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14011579/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "16f3419a03bc884d0572d8450c77f4f040ab0c9cc4ce6633fc99805621d7cfb1"} {"question" "q-49136" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14011579/state.json" "file_sha256" "21f765d7644b2a4215157c91d70040aa3df95546068e8540b64200d7169e2600"} {"question" "q-49136" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "2\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x+3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+C"] ["math" "2\\text{ arcsec }x-3\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+C"] ["math" "2\\text{ arcsec }x-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C"] ["math" "3\\operatorname{sec}⁡x-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C"] ["math" "6\\text{ arcsec }x-\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14011579/state.json" "file_sha256" "21f765d7644b2a4215157c91d70040aa3df95546068e8540b64200d7169e2600"} {"question" "q-49136" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "2\\text{ arcsec }x-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14011579/state.json" "file_sha256" "21f765d7644b2a4215157c91d70040aa3df95546068e8540b64200d7169e2600"} {"question" "q-49150" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\int \\frac{{x}^{2}-7}{{x}^{2}+1}\\,\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14011579/state.json" "file_sha256" "21f765d7644b2a4215157c91d70040aa3df95546068e8540b64200d7169e2600"} {"question" "q-49150" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "This integral doesn't look like one of the basic ones. However, we can manipulate the numerator a bit  to make it look more like the denominator, which reveals a more familiar expression: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x)=\\frac{{x}^{2}-7}{{x}^{2}+1} & =\\frac{{x}^{2}+1-1-7}{{x}^{2}+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{({x}^{2}+1)-8}{{x}^{2}+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\cancel{{x}^{2}+1}}{\\cancel{{x}^{2}+1}}-\\frac{8}{{x}^{2}+1} \\\\  & =1-\\frac{8}{{x}^{2}+1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nRemembering that\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}\\text{d}x=\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C,\n$$\n\nwe can now calculate the integral and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x)=\\int {f}^{′}(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (1-\\frac{8}{{x}^{2}+1})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\text{d}x-\\int \\frac{8}{{x}^{2}+1}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\text{d}x-8\\int \\frac{1}{{x}^{2}+1}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =x-8\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14011579/state.json" "file_sha256" "21f765d7644b2a4215157c91d70040aa3df95546068e8540b64200d7169e2600"} {"question" "q-49150" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14011579/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "16f3419a03bc884d0572d8450c77f4f040ab0c9cc4ce6633fc99805621d7cfb1"} {"question" "q-49150" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14011579/state.json" "file_sha256" "21f765d7644b2a4215157c91d70040aa3df95546068e8540b64200d7169e2600"} {"question" "q-49150" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "6x-\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C"] ["math" "8x+\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C"] ["math" "x+6\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C"] ["math" "x-6\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C"] ["math" "x-8\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14011579/state.json" "file_sha256" "21f765d7644b2a4215157c91d70040aa3df95546068e8540b64200d7169e2600"} {"question" "q-49150" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "x-8\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14011579/state.json" "file_sha256" "21f765d7644b2a4215157c91d70040aa3df95546068e8540b64200d7169e2600"} {"question" "q-71768" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "If ${f}^{′}(x)=5{x}^{4}+\\frac{7}{1+{x}^{2}},$ then $f(x)=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14011579/state.json" "file_sha256" "21f765d7644b2a4215157c91d70040aa3df95546068e8540b64200d7169e2600"} {"question" "q-71768" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Recall that \n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}\\text{d}x=\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x)=\\int {f}^{′}(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (5{x}^{4}+\\frac{7}{1+{x}^{2}})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int 5{x}^{4}\\,\\text{d}x+\\int \\frac{7}{1+{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =5\\int {x}^{4}\\,\\text{d}x+7\\int \\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =5\\cdot \\frac{{x}^{5}}{5}+7\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C \\\\  & ={x}^{5}+7\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14011579/state.json" "file_sha256" "21f765d7644b2a4215157c91d70040aa3df95546068e8540b64200d7169e2600"} {"question" "q-71768" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14011579/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "16f3419a03bc884d0572d8450c77f4f040ab0c9cc4ce6633fc99805621d7cfb1"} {"question" "q-71768" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14011579/state.json" "file_sha256" "21f765d7644b2a4215157c91d70040aa3df95546068e8540b64200d7169e2600"} {"question" "q-71768" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "5{x}^{5}+7\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x+C"] ["math" "5{x}^{5}+7\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C"] ["math" "{x}^{5}+7\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C"] ["math" "{x}^{5}+7\\text{ arccot }x+C"] ["math" "{x}^{5}+7\\text{ arcsec }x+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14011579/state.json" "file_sha256" "21f765d7644b2a4215157c91d70040aa3df95546068e8540b64200d7169e2600"} {"question" "q-71768" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "{x}^{5}+7\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14011579/state.json" "file_sha256" "21f765d7644b2a4215157c91d70040aa3df95546068e8540b64200d7169e2600"} {"question" "q-114164" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\int (3{x}^{2}+\\frac{7}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}})\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14011579/state.json" "file_sha256" "21f765d7644b2a4215157c91d70040aa3df95546068e8540b64200d7169e2600"} {"question" "q-114164" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x=\\text{arcsec}\\,x.\n$$\n\nTherefore,  we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (3{x}^{2}+\\frac{7}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}})\\text{d}x & =\\int 3{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x+\\int \\frac{7}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3\\int {x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x+7\\int \\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3(\\frac{{x}^{3}}{3})+7(\\text{ arcsec }x)+C \\\\  & ={x}^{3}+7\\text{ arcsec }x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14011579/state.json" "file_